sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Task / Orchestrator
  participant G as TITO Gateway
  participant R as Rollout GPUs
  participant B as Buffer
  participant L as Learner GPUs
  E->>G: 工具任务请求
  G->>R: Exact token IDs
  R-->>G: IDs + logp + mask + versions
  G-->>E: 生成结果，继续环境交互
  G->>B: 保存轨迹与元数据
  Note over R,L: 两个 GPU pools 独立运行
  B->>B: 环境失败 / version lag 过滤
  B->>L: 达到门槛，取训练 batch
  L->>L: Current logp → ratio → strict mask
  L->>L: 更新权重；工具观察不计 loss
  L-->>R: 周期刷新 serving weights
  Note over G,R: Rollout ID 固定 DP rank，复用 prefix KV
